# Exception: policy PDFs rebuilt from the Drive viewer by
# scripts/seed/12-drive-pdf-rescue.py. They are not regenerable without network
# access to the original Drive links, and the attachment route serves them at
# /api/attachments/rescued_pdf/<file>, so Render needs them in the image.
!data/
!data/guta_rescued_pdf/
!data/guta_rescued_pdf/**
/dashboard/

